# Dev Server Restart

After making code changes to this project, always kill the running Next.js dev server and restart it:

```bash
# Kill any running dev server on ports 3000/3001
lsof -ti:3000,3001 2>/dev/null | xargs kill -9 2>/dev/null

# Restart dev server
cd /Users/himanshu.jain/Desktop/workout-logger && npm run dev
```

- Check terminals for an existing dev server before starting a new one
- Kill the existing process before restarting
- Wait for "Ready" output before considering the server started
